      <h2 id="olmv1-catalog-exclusion-by-labels-or-expressions_catalog-content-resolution" class="group scroll-mt-20">Catalog exclusion by labels or expressions<a href="#olmv1-catalog-exclusion-by-labels-or-expressions_catalog-content-resolution" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
